window.products.push({"id":315031,"name":"Giantex 5-Tier Ventilated Shelving Storage Rack,Free Standing Multi-Use Shelf Unit, No Tools Required, 36”L X 18”W X 73”H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f6KGNWfeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Enlarge Your Storage Space: Our open display rack will enlarge your storage space horizontally and vertically while take up less space. Many of your things which include tools, plants and pots can be kept in order on the shelf and for easy taking. After using this practical rack, your room will be clean and tidy. Sturdy Frame with Large Weight Capacity: Constructed of thick and solid material, the whole frame of the rack is sturdy and provides large weight capacity about 66lbs of each tier. Every part can be connected tightly which ensures the stableness of the rack. The whole rack has no peculiar smell please feel relieved about usage. Prevent Tilting or Falling: For each rack, there are 2 wall brackets and 2 connecting rings. The brackets can be hooked on the tube tightly and it is easy to hammer nails to the wall. And if you buy 2 or more racks, the connecting rings can fix them together. You don’t need to worry about falling forward of the rack at all when you want to take something from the rack. Multifunctional Shelf: If you consider the rack is too high to place in some places, the number of layers can be reduced to meet your needs. Not only this rack can be placed in your garage to put some tools on but also can be an open shelf in the kitchen for some cookers. Install with No Tool & Easy Cleaning: According to the instruction, you can assemble the rack by yourself in few minutes with no tool. All the parts and accessories are in the parcel with good level of protection. The surface of the rack is scratch-proof and waterproof so that the rack can be cleaned with wet cloth easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f6KGNWfeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B07Y3CQHRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y3CQHRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y3CQHRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":315032,"name":"storeindya Vintage Wooden Towel Hook Wall Hanger Coat Hooks Key Hat Scarf Bags Wall Mounted Handmade Key Ring Holder with 2 Metal Hooks Home Decor Acc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ef2tm4tyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Store Indya is a travel quest to unravel the forgotten hand crafted skills of India… Store Indya was something that was created as a result of family trips we took across India. While travelling, we not only saw different cultures in different parts of India, but we also realized each corner of India has its own secret. They all have their own unique art forms that is known to only a very few in India, and almost unknown to the rest of the world. We discovered that these age-old glorious skills are getting suppressed. The artisans that we work with are a handful of people that are trying to continue the dying legacy of their artwork. Each artwork handcrafted by them is an end product of their hard and meticulous work. Store Indya wants to revive these art forms and at the same time empower these skilled artists, introducing them to new frontiers of the world. We want to amalgamate different art forms and create a whole new product by itself that has never been created before. Overall, these products not only stand for aesthetics and traditions, but the designs on it also represent various socio-cultural issues that we want to talk about with the world and even encourage others to talk about it by gifting these handicrafts to one another. We want our products to not just sit quietly, looking pretty in a corner of your habitat, but in fact speak your mind. We at Store Indya believe in – “Design to empower.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ef2tm4tyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"storeindya","source_asin":"B01IH2RY2E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IH2RY2E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IH2RY2E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
