window.products.push({"id":315046,"name":"Elite Home Grand Hotel All-Natural 100-Percent Cotton Basket Woven Blanket Full/Queen Size, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819jrUTs2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elite Home Grand Hotel All-Natural 100-Percent Cotton Basket Woven Blanket—Bring the perfect touch of style, good looks and softness to any bed in your home. The Grand Hotel blanket is constructed from all-natural 100-percent yarn-dyed cotton with a unique basket weave pattern and technique. The cotton has been mercerized making it exceptionally durable, breathable and soft to the hand. The tight stitch of the basket weave creates a wonderful texture, while providing maximum thermal properties and being made of all-natural fibers assures that it will withstand everyday wear and tear for years of warmth and luxurious comfort. A 1-inch self-binding hem is constructed into the blanket to provide strength and add a clean crisp edge. Full/queen size Grand Hotel Blanket measures 90-by-90 inches. Conveniently Machine wash cold, tumble dry low","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819jrUTs2OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Home","source_asin":"B003LPTK1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003LPTK1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003LPTK1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":315047,"name":"Innovation CuteInnovation Rechargeable Self Stirring Mug - Magnetic Electric Auto Mixing Stainless Steel Cup for OfficeKitchenTravelHome CoffeeTeaHot ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rTpBXcdkS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Coffee Mug for Lazy People Powered by rechargeable lithium ion cell battery, the CuteInnovation coffee mug is a great accessory to have in your kitchen.But more so, this is considered the best beverage-mug for 'lazy people'. If you consider the hassle of washing spoons, stirring beverages and then washing again to be quite a bother, this coffee mug simply does the work for you.All you need to do is pour in your coffee (or any other beverage for that matter) and then press a button. Does everything within seconds. Nice Feel, Great Look This premium self-stirring coffee mug looks great all the way, and feels even better on any kitchen ecosystem. The power-on button is conveniently located at the top of the hold-handle, so you can easily turn the propeller on. When empty, the inside has an appealing, clean-silverish look, which blends with the dark exterior for an overly appealing design.Easy Operation While this coffee mug looks great on any kitchen counter board and/or coffee table, its essence is to make work easier. More than the typical self-stirring coffee mug, this kitchen accessory works in an easy, convenient way. Simply press the self-stirring button on the mug and the propeller at the bottom will spin into action, mixing the solute and solvent particles into a lovely froth.No sweat, no hassle, just a product that makes stirring beverages a whole lot easier! Airtight Lid With Small Drinking Hole If you love to sip at your coffee while you spin out of your home in the morning rush, this is the perfect accessory to have in our kitchen. The CuteInnovation self-stirring coffee mug not just brings the benefits of instant stirring action to your coffee making moments, but also comes with an airtight lid equipped with a small drinking hole.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rTpBXcdkS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Innovation","source_asin":"B0953PJJFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0953PJJFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0953PJJFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
