window.products.push({"id":315095,"name":"HeyDreamy Reversible Sateen Cotton 3-Piece Quilted Duvet Cover Set with Cotton Fill, 2-in-1 Bedding Set (Purple, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QaMh01mkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add Fun to Your Bedroom Decor Enjoy dreamy comfort with HeyDreamy’s 3-piece reversible duvet cover and quilt set. This sateen cotton duvet cover set includes a modern tie dye batik pattern that will brighten up any room. The coverlet's reversible design allows you to switch up your bedroom's look whenever you want. The complete coverlet set includes two pillow shams and a duvet cover/coverlet with cotton filling. High-Quality Cotton Sateen Designed for comfort and durability, this reversible bedding set is made from soft and breathable cotton material with a sateen finish. The coverlet/duvet cover includes four inner corner ties to stabilize the filling's core so the filling always remains evenly distributed. To ensure optimal quality, the bed set is OEKO-TEX certified for high safety and environmental standards. Easy Care: Machine Washable and Dryer Friendly The bedding set is easy to care for. Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle. Wash dark colors separately. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low heat. Iron on low heat if needed. Free Gift: Each HeyDreamy purchase comes with a complimentary dreamcatcher (while supplies last). To avoid danger of suffocation, keep the plastic bag away from infants and children. Do not use the bag in cribs, beds, carriages, or play pens. This bag is not a toy. CHOKING HAZARD - Not for children under 3 years. Use with adult supervision. About HeyDreamy™ HeyDreamy™ began with a simple philosophy that every day is an opportunity to follow your dreams and enjoy life. As an award winning manufacturer of many global prestigious bedding brands, HeyDreamy cares deeply about the impact our business has on local communities and the environment. All of HeyDreamy collections are crafted with care through eco-friendly techniques and sustainable practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QaMh01mkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeyDreamy","source_asin":"B07PZXYBVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PZXYBVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PZXYBVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
