window.products.push({"id":315319,"name":"VEDDOS 20oz Tumbler Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Double Wall Coffee Mug, Thermal Cup with Standard Lid, Straw & Brush, Leak Proof, Gift (Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EaPhJUCCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VEDDOS tumbler is engineered to keep all liquids at your desired temperature all day long. The double wall design with advanced vacuum insulation are some of the few sellers in this market that can offer. The inner and outer material of the tumbler  body is premium 18/8 stainless steel.  The lid is shatter resistant and BPA free. Here at VEDDOS, the management truly cares about every customer’s experience with the tumbler you purchase. We don't compromise quality for the sake of price as we hold a high standard.We have a strict quality control process in place to ensure consistent quality of our products.We are so confident in our products that you will have a peace of mind when you choose our tumblers. Key Benefits of VEDDOS Tumblers : -        Outstanding insulation properties due to advanced process used in the manufacturing of our products. This double wall vacuum sealed insulation keeps liquids Hot or Cold for many hours. -        Impact and Dent Resistance, Corrosion and Stain Resistance - 18/8 food grade stainless steel used for the vacuum double wall mentioned above. VEDDOS Tumblers incorporate thicker wall material compared to our competitors. In return this makes the VEDDOS tumbler more durable with better insulation. -        Powder Coating for lasting color–Powder coating may seem extreme for a tumbler but notfor VEDDOS tumblers. Paint chipping will no longer be an issue with VEDDOS powder coated tumblers. -        BPA-free Lids with NO Leaking - VEDDOS lids are made of premium material, BPA free. They are more durable than other lids on the market. As the lids are  engineered for our tumblers, they don’t expand or contract due to hot or cold temperature, and keep the seal tight for leak free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EaPhJUCCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEDDOS","source_asin":"B08KLJQMYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KLJQMYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KLJQMYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
