window.products.push({"id":315345,"name":"SAMYO 72ft 200 LED 2 Light Modes Waterproof Solar Fairy Lights String for Outdoor Gardens Homes Christmas Lighting Party (Multicolor)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RPuvra7HL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This solar LED lights fairy string is environment-friendly products with high engey conversion rate and long working life, perfect for indoor & outdoor decoration, such as gardens, patio, lawn, yard, etc. It adds warmth and atmosphere to any garden, beautifies your yard, garden and trees. With good sun exposure, expect 8 hours of illumination or more, as performance is directly related to the amount of sunshine received. Specification: *Length of String: About 72 Ft(22M) *200 LED at 10cm spacing *Ni-Mh Batteries :AA size,1800mAH,1pcs *Light source: 200 LED *2 different function modes : Flashing and steady on. *Working temperature:-20℃～+60℃ *The Solar string light consists of a LED string light, a solar panel unit and a stake. Package Included: 1 x 200 LED Solar Power String Light (Multicolor)  1 x Ground Spike Note: 1, Make sure the switch is turned to \"ON\" or“FLASH”, if not, the battery will not be charged. 2, Please make sure that the solar panel is pointed toward the sunlight. At least 6 hours of exposure to sunlight is required for illumination. 3, Although the solar panel will continue to collect energy on cloudy, rainy and snowy days, The volume of solar energy converted and stored everyday decides lighting performance, a lower amount of energy collected will lower the duration of light production.  4, Panel must be in dark/dim environment for the lights to come on (simply cover the solar panel to turn on light in brighter environment after power is charged).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RPuvra7HL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMYO","source_asin":"B00KVE2AZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KVE2AZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KVE2AZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
