window.products.push({"id":315354,"name":"Chef Tacos Mortar and Pestle Set, Kitchen Grinder, Granite, 6-Inch 2-Cup Capacity | Spice Grinder Mortar and Pestle, Guacamole Bowl, Molcajete Mexican","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71agrlAxjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 2 CUP CAPACITY. Mash, muddle, paste, and grind up to 2 cups of ingredients. The Chef Taco stone mortar and pestle is a must-have kitchen essential for chefs and home cooks who love freshly ground herbs & spices. And perfect for homemade salsas and pastes. ✅ EASY GRINDING. The pestle is heavy duty, but its wide design is easy and comfortable to hold. Giving you greater control over your grinding while minimizing arm fatigue. So you can grind more consistently and get the perfect texture every time. From fine powder, to chunky paste - and everything in between. ✅ NON-POROUS GRANITE. Built to last from authentic high quality stone. Non-porous granite is both stain and scent resistant. So you can confidently grind foods with bold colors or pungent aromas (hello garlic!) without risk of lingering stains or odors. ✅ TRADITIONAL UNPOLISHED FINISH. Raw, but smooth granite is comfortable to handle, but textured enough to tackle whatever you have to throw at it. A classic stone grinder mocajetes is the chef preferred go-to companion for grinding nuts, spices, tough herbs, peppers, and even chai tea! ✅ DOUBLES AS SERVING BOWL. Our mortar’s wide mouth means plenty of room for holding dips, salsas, and our favorite - guacamole! So you can grind & combine your ingredients, and serve delicious chips and homemade dip right from the same bowl. Plus with beautiful authentic granite, it’s an attractive statement piece to add to your serveware collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71agrlAxjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Tacos","source_asin":"B092JMVNZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JMVNZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JMVNZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
