window.products.push({"id":315424,"name":"Oaken-Cat Reversible Down Alternative Comforter King - 3pcs Cloud Fluffy Breathable Microfiber Comforter Set with Shams, Ultra-Soft Brushed Washed Fab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MiRGBzdKL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"100% Pre-washed & Brushed Microfiber Polyester Fabric / 100% Polyester Microfiber With Hydrophilic Fiberfill 💤 WHAT IS INSIDE - This microfiber comforter set includes one KING Size Down Alternative Comforter (104” by 86”) and 2 Shams (or 1 Sham for Twin sizes). Come with brand new package, please air and spread it at first time use. Use it as a stand-alone comforter or comforter insert with your favorite duvet cover. Machine washed & dryable. 100-days return and replacement guarantee. 💤 SUPER SOFT AND COZY - Crafted from extremely soft double brushed & pre-washed microfiber fabric, combined just right amount of a luxurious plush, down-like microfiber filling, our all season down alternative comforter set is truly fluffy, soft, lightweight, breathable, cozy-everything you need for your all years dreamy night’s sleep. 💤 TWO COMFORTERS IN ONE - Both sides of our reversible comforter feature our ultra-soft microfiber in two of trend right colors, the matching shams coordinate beautifully with the comforter for a fresh finished look. Feature a solid box stitch to contain the fill and prevent shifting or bunching--never any clumping or cool spots. Choose this reversible comforter with trend color (Such as Solid White, Yellow/Gray, Red/Beige, Grey/Red, Green/Light Brown, Light Blue/Dark Blue etc). 💤 FLUFFY & BREATHABLE - Filled with soft polyester Polyfill mixed Lyocell - source from eucalyptus trees, treated with nano-hydrophilic materials, our microfiber comforter can absorb moisture and sweat quickly, cleverly regulate body temperature to keep you cool, dry and provide head-to-toe warmth. It's compliant to GRS, OEKO-Tex Standard 100. 💤 CONFIDENT MATERIAL- Sustainable polymer compliant to the GRS and OEKO-Tex Standard 100 is Lightweight, Noise-Free and more Breathable, NO Tearing or Horrible Odor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MiRGBzdKL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oaken-Cat","source_asin":"B089DP2871","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089DP2871","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089DP2871","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
