window.products.push({"id":315729,"name":"Ozone Machine Generator 20000mg/h High Capacity Long-life quartz ozone tube,Ozone Machine Odor Removal,Suitable for Large Space Areas home,Basement,Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EUV34fv6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BETTER RESULTS WITH UNIQUE PULSING FUNCTION: Double-sided circuit board with 20000 mg/h modulating fan speed and ozone output to create a \"pulsing\" effect. Painted with three-proof protective paint to improve moisture resistance, corrosion resistance and oxidation resistance, the service life is more than 20,000 hours. Powerful enough to clean and deodorize 5,000 square feet of space, primarily new homes, garages, offices, basements, hotels, farms and bars. Common Uses: Cars, Boats, Dumpsters, Kitchens, Bathrooms, Basements, Flood and Fire affected areas and any cooking, smoking, pets, \"musty\" or general odor decontamination. SAFETY - 180 minute timer with \"HOLD\" function: Turn the timer knob. You can set the timer for up to 180 minutes before leaving the room with your pet. Ozone reacts with certain substances and purifies the air. Excess ozone is automatically converted into oxygen. safe! FAST PURIFICATION: The powerful fan of the ozone generat0r for home can quickly diffuse the ozone into the room, combine with pollutants and destroy them, producing fresh oxygen. A 300 sq ft space can be completely purified in 10 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EUV34fv6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VTAR","source_asin":"B09TVMWGXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TVMWGXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TVMWGXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
