window.products.push({"id":315819,"name":"skyehomo Electric Grain Mill Grinder,High-speed Spice Herb Mill, 70-300 Mesh Safety Commercial Powder Machine For Kitchen Spice Herb Pepper Coffee Cor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JxQ+u2kuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: 1.The grinder has fine structure, low noise, small size, no vibration, modern appearance, simple and convenient operation. 2.The grinding machine has strong grinding ability,except extremely hard material takes 2-3min to grind, normal grains only needs 30s to be ground into 70 to 300 mesh superfine power. 3.The grinder can process a variety of dry materials, including ① grains (soybeans, corn, barley, rice, wheat, oats, peas, peanuts, walnuts, coffee beans) ② spices (star anise, fennel, pepper, cinnamon, rosemary) ③ Vanilla (Ginseng, Astragalus, Chinese wolfberry, Ganoderma lucidum) Specifications: Material:stainless steel Capacity:500g(1.1 lbs) Voltage:110V Rated power:2500w Frequency:60Hz Fineness:70-300Mesh Rotation speed:36000 r/min Working time:5 minutes Interval time:10 minutes Crushed Level:superfine mill Tips: 1.Disconnect the power before opening. 2.The material to be ground must be dry. Wet or oily materials should not be ground into powder. 3.Each input material shall not exceed the rated weight or half of the capacity of the crushing bin. 4.After switch on, if the material is found to be wet or heavy, the blade will be stuck and a warning noise will be issued. So must plug out immediately to avoid damage to the motor. Remove the jammed object and start grinding again. 5.The grinding work of the grinder usually guarantees 30 seconds to 1 or 2 minutes. Working for a long time can cause the bearing to overheat. 6.It is normal for the grinder to have a slight heat when it is working. 7.Due to different shooting effects, chromatic aberration may occur. 8.Manual measurement, the error is 1-3cm, subject to the actual situation, please understand. Thanks! Package Included: 1 x 500g Grain Mill Grinder 1 x Replacement Blade 1 x Brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JxQ+u2kuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"skyehomo","source_asin":"B0B81VSWK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B81VSWK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B81VSWK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":315820,"name":"Chic Modern Adjustable Synthetic Leather Swivel Bar Stools - Camel - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DGcXgHkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chic bar stools are just that, Chic. These stools will add high style to your home, office, or restaurant/bar and features a bright chrome base and footstool with a ultra-supportive cushioned faux leather seat. Suitable for most any environment, the simple one piece seat employs quilted faux leather stitched over copious amounts of padding to provide excellent levels of comfort. The mid-level backrest gives good support to the lower spine. The chromed stand with adjustable height gas lift holds up the seat in a fashion that makes it seem as though it is hovering in the air. A round base with rubber protection for your floor, 360 degree swivel and the round footrest make the Chic different from the usual run-of-the-mill bar stools and gives more visual impact. A simple yet well executed design that goes a long way. Each bar stool comes complete with an adjustable gas lift tested to operate at least 100,000 times! Measures about 17.7\" wide by 18.5\" deep and adjusts from table to counter/bar height (33.6\" to 44.1\" total height or 22.4\" to 32.3\" for the seat height). Seat height is about 11.8\" from the center of the seat. Base has a 15.7\" diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DGcXgHkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Mission","source_asin":"B00725BVQI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00725BVQI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00725BVQI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
