window.products.push({"id":315836,"name":"Hot Cup Sleeves ] Gifts for Sea Turtle Lovers ] Insulated Coffee Cup Sleeves for Starbucks and Dunkin Donuts Drinks by Island Style Creations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xVUCGNpvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say hello to your new favorite coffee companion and goodbye to those flimsy cardboard drink sleeves. Whether you’re dreaming of the beach over a hot cup of coffee or sitting poolside with an iced tea, you’ll absolutely adore our Hawaiian themed Honu turtle insulated coffee cup sleeve. It’s made of latex-free neoprene, the same material used in wetsuits. We chose this fabric when designing our reusable coffee sleeves because it’s a time-tested material that resists stains, holds up to wear and tear and is a great insulator. No more hot spots or soggy cardboard – our sleeves stay comfortable to the touch through a wide range of temperatures and absorb condensation, preventing dampness and drips. When you’re done, just tuck our drink sleeve into your pocket, purse or console. It’s ultra-lightweight, compact and compressible design makes this the most convenient reusable drink insulator on the market and its tapered, stretchable design means it will fit your favorite drink. What better way to keep your hot drinks hot or your cold drinks cool while expressing your Aloha spirit than with this Hawaiian style cup insulator sleeve? A great turtle themed gift for any occasion that’s sure to please the Hawaiian at heart. Island Style Creations stands behind our products and values our customers, which is why we offer a total 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you aren’t happy with your drink sleeve, just get in touch and we’ll make it right – no hassles. Buy with confidence! Product Features: - Reusable, Eco-Friendly Solution - Insulates Both Hot and Cold Drinks - Durable, Latex Free Neoprene Fabric - Seamless, Unified Design - Hawaiian, Honu Turtle Theme - Fits Most Cup Sizes, Pint Glasses and Water Bottles - The Best Quality for the Best Value - Satisfaction Guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xVUCGNpvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Island Style Creations","source_asin":"B0723HKBLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0723HKBLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0723HKBLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
