window.products.push({"id":315952,"name":"Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine, Portable Fruit Cleaner Device, USB Wireless Food Purifier Vegetable Washer, Ultrasonic Vegetable Cleaner with OH-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bPa836X8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥦【Electrolytic Sheet Purification Technology】Our fruit and vegetable cleaner is different from other fruit and vegetable machine, other fruit and vegetable machine built-in is stainless steel sheet, cleaning fruits and vegetables to remove residual harmful ingredients without effect, our fruit and vegetable cleaner built-in ruthenium-iridium electrolytic sheet, water as raw material, water in the purification bin role, decomposition into hydroxyl radical hydroxide ions, chloride ions, rapid degradation of harmful substances into harmless substances. 🍍【Highly Efficient Purification of Fruits and Vegetables】Fruit cleaner uses OH ions that can penetrate into the crevices through strong oxidation and weak alkalinity to thoroughly clean and remove 99% of residual harmful ingredients and extend storage time.No chemical addition. Simple and safe extra cleaning of fruits,vegetables,beans,rice and meat. 🍇【Easy to Clean and Removable】The fruit and vegetable washing machine is very easy to use, just press the switch and put it into the water. Let fruit cleaner sit for 10 minutes to complete the cleaning, without any other operations. Vegetable cleaner device can purify fruits and vegetables, aquatic products, meat, tableware, cereals, kitchenware, glasses and jewelry. Also, the food purifier can be rotated flexibly, so it is convenient to disassemble and clean. 🍓【Wireless and Portable】Fruit and vegetable washer can be charged through USB magnetic absorption. Built-in 4400mAh rechargeable battery can be used 25-30 times after fully charged. The fruit cleaner device in water is IPX7 waterproof. You can immerse veggie cleaner ​in water without worrying about leakage or damage. The fruit and vegetable washing machine is in capsule shape, small and portable, suitable for outdoor travel. 🌽【Wide application】The fruit and vegetable wash is widely used to clean fruits, vegetables, rice, fish, meat, seafood, food, and purify tap water, glasses, and jewelry. It can help your family get rid of the tedious work of cleaning food, save time, and harvest health. Perfect for home kitchens. In addition, it is the perfect gift for wife, mother and friends. 🥕【Safety and service】The fruit and vegetable cleaning device adopts IPX7 waterproof standard, which can be safely used.Please read the manual carefully before use.If you are not satisfied with our fruit and vegetable purifier, we will give you a full refund. We strive to provide you with satisfactory service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bPa836X8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DROEAY","source_asin":"B0C6J737QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-315952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6J737QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6J737QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
